     <td style="padding-top:0in;border-left:1pt solid #000000;padding-left:0.08in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding-right:0.08in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:1.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Severance Benefits</span></p></td>
     <td style="padding-top:0in;border-left:1pt solid #000000;padding-left:0.08in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding-right:0.08in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:1.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></td>
     <td style="padding-top:0in;padding-left:0.08in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding-right:0.08in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:1.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">General severance benefits are payable upon an NEO&#8217;s qualifying termination of employment as specified under the NEOs&#8217; employment agreements.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Severance benefits payable in connection with a change in control require an NEO to incur a qualifying termination of employment within a specified period following a change of control. No excise tax gross-ups are provided.</span></p></td>
     <td style="padding-top:0in;border-left:1pt solid #000000;padding-left:0.08in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding-right:0.08in;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:1.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></td>
